; Guard sprites, frame B (4 directions)
;
; The second animation frame of the guard's head: 4 sprites of 32 bytes in the order up, right, down, left, in the
; same layout as #R$7DC7. Used by #R$663D (DrawGuard) when bit 5 of the guard's animation counter is clear.
;
@label=GuardSprites2
b$7E47 DEFB $1F,$3F,$3F,$3F,$5F,$63,$7C,$7F ; up (no face): top-left cell
